You 're right , Mrs. Bundy .

1270
01:21:39,978 --> 01:21:41,146
What 's the matter ? Something wrong out here ?

1271
01:21:41,230 --> 01:21:43,023
We 're fighting a war , Sam .

1272
01:21:43,857 --> 01:21:45,317
A war ? Against who ?

1273
01:21:45,401 --> 01:21:46,527
Against birds !

1274
01:21:46,610 --> 01:21:48,904
I 'm glad you all think this is so amusing .

1275
01:21:48,987 --> 01:21:50,656
You 've frightened the children half out of their wits .

1276
01:21:50,739 --> 01:21:51,865
If the young lady said

1277
01:21:51,949 --> 01:21:54,827
she saw the attack at a school , why don 't you believe her ?

1278
01:21:54,868 --> 01:21:56,036
What attack ? Who attacked the school ?

1279
01:21:56,120 --> 01:21:57,788
WOMAN : Birds did . Crows .

1280
01:21:58,330 --> 01:22:00,207
You 're all sitting around here debating !

1281
